<title>USA: Rensselaer City SD, N.Y., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Rensselaer City SD, N.Y., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc., said it won $8.05 million of Rensselaer City Sch Dist, N.Y., general obligation school district bonds of 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.814 percent.</p>
</text>
